WEBVTT

00:12:57.940 --> 00:13:00.777
It still works effectively today.

00:13:01.444 --> 00:13:03.813
It still works effectively.
Keep it simple.

00:13:03.813 --> 00:13:05.815
If you're going to write about a banana,

00:13:05.815 --> 00:13:08.851
you're not going to call it
an elongated yellow piece of fruit.

00:13:08.885 --> 00:13:10.486
You're going to call it a banana.

00:13:10.486 --> 00:13:12.588
If you're going to talk
about someone lying,

00:13:12.622 --> 00:13:15.558
you're not going to say prevaricate,
you're going to say lie.

00:13:15.591 --> 00:13:17.093
Keep it simple.

00:13:17.126 --> 00:13:20.263
Which relates as well to point four,

00:13:20.296 --> 00:13:21.597
which is: be human.

00:13:21.631 --> 00:13:23.066
Write like a human.

00:13:23.066 --> 00:13:25.802
I see this in journalism all the time.

00:13:25.835 --> 00:13:29.639
I don't understand
what happened to our species

00:13:29.672 --> 00:13:33.710
that when you put a pen in our hand
or a keyboard in front of us,